Apple announced the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a> and &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max earlier this month, arriving four years after the iPhone 14 Pro and iPhone 14 Pro Max. <br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/iphone-14-pro-vs-iphone-18-pro.jpg" alt="" width="1672" height="941" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1066387" /><br/>
Four generations of changes make for a substantial upgrade, bringing larger displays, an all-new design, improvements to every camera, significantly longer battery life, faster charging, USB-C connectivity, and support for <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-intelligence/">Apple Intelligence</a>.<br/>
<br/>
The iPhone 15 Pro replaced the stainless steel frame with titanium, introduced the Action button and USB-C port, and added the A17 Pro chip. The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-16/">iPhone 16</a> Pro introduced larger displays with thinner borders, the Camera Control, a 48-megapixel Ultra Wide camera, and improved video and audio recording. The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17-pro/">iPhone 17 Pro</a> replaced the titanium frame and glass back with an aluminum unibody, added vapor chamber cooling and Ceramic Shield 2, and upgraded both the telephoto and front-facing cameras. This year's refresh centers on the A20 Pro chip, a variable-aperture Main camera, a smaller <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/dynamic-island/">Dynamic Island</a>, and a <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-max-battery-capacities/">further increase in battery capacity</a>. For iPhone 14 Pro owners, all four sets of changes accumulate.<br/>
<br/>
The &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-pricing/">starts at &#36;1,199</a> for 256GB, &#36;200 more than the iPhone 14 Pro's &#36;999 launch price, although the entry storage tier has doubled from 128GB. The &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max starts at &#36;1,299, also &#36;200 more than the iPhone 14 Pro Max's &#36;1,099 launch price, with the same increase in base storage. Here are the key differences between the iPhone 14 Pro and &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj;:<br/>
